  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Green Port Communications Pilot Project, through ARES Security Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant partially funds a Pilot Project and Feasibility Study to assist the Qinhuangdao Port Co., Ltd. with assessing the ability of U.S. technology to reduce the environmental impact of port operations. The Pilot Project and Feasibility Study is demonstrating the capabilities of software developed by ARES Security Corporation and environmental monitoring systems developed by its partner, Triad Engineering Applications. The project&apos;s costs are being shared by the sole source contractor, ARES Security Corporation.</narrative>
  </description>
